    "description": "Item Description:\n7+ Piece Lot of White/Clear Natural Quartz Crystal Points & Mineral Clusters\nA lot of more than seven quartz crystal formations and mineral clusters/ crystal points, some translucent and clear, some semi-opaque. The total weight of this lot is 1 lb 11 oz. The sizes of the various pieces are 5\"x3\", 3\"x2\" (3 pieces); 3\"x 1.5\", 2.5\"x 1\", 1.5\", 1\", and 3/4\" plus a few smaller fragments. One cluster has a crystal point sticking up nearly straight out of its surrounding matrix, others lay more flat with crossed crystal points. See photos for more details\nManufacturer/Markings:\nThese are natural materials from the earth.\nDimensions (LxWxH):\nnoted above.\nColor(s):\nsome translucent and clear, some semi-opaque, white.\nCondition/Damage:\nSome have black ink or paint marks/dirt, some have broken edges, as is natural for this material. Points and crystal structure are clear and recognizable.\nModel number, if applicable:\nNone, this is a natural material.\nWeight of item:\nApp. 1 lb 11 oz\nUsed Items Disclaimer\nThis is a pre-owned item and is being sold \"AS IS \" If you have any questions concerning this item, feel free to contact us.\nWe describe our items to the best of our ability and try to incorporate as much research as possible with books andInternet, however, we are not experts in any field.\nEvery person has the opportunity to achieve his/her fullest potential and participate in and contribute to all aspects of life, and with your help, you are making dreams come true.\nGoodwill of Southeast Georgia, Thank you for your continued support!",
